<% if @event.rsvp_needed? %>
RSVP REQUIRED - <%= @event.name %>
<% else %>
NEW EVENT - <%= @event.name %>
<% end %>
<%= @lounge.name %>

Hi <%= @member.first_name %>!

<% if @event.rsvp_needed? %>
You're invited to an exciting event at <%= @lounge.name %> and we need your RSVP:
<% else %>
We're excited to invite you to an upcoming event at <%= @lounge.name %>:
<% end %>

EVENT DETAILS:
==============
Name: <%= @event.name %>
Date: <%= @event.date.strftime("%A, %B %d, %Y") %>
Time: <%= @event.start_time.strftime("%I:%M %p") %> - <%= @event.end_time.strftime("%I:%M %p") %>
Type: <%= @event.event_type %>
<% if @event.description.present? %>

Description:
<%= @event.description %>
<% end %>

<% if @event.rsvp_needed? && @rsvp_url %>
RSVP REQUIRED:
==============
Please confirm your attendance by visiting this link:
<%= @rsvp_url %>

Your RSVP will help us plan the perfect event experience.

Note: This RSVP link will expire 1 hour before the event starts. 
If you have any questions, please contact the lounge directly.
<% else %>
We look forward to seeing you there! No RSVP required - just come and enjoy the experience.
<% end %>

LOCATION & CONTACT:
==================
Location: <%= @lounge.name %>
<% if @lounge.address_street_1.present? %>
Address: <%= @lounge.address_street_1 %>, <%= @lounge.city %>, <%= @lounge.state %> <%= @lounge.zip_code %>
<% end %>

Questions? Contact us at <%= @lounge.email %> or <%= @lounge.phone_number %>

---
This email was sent by <%= @lounge.name %>
Powered by Herf
